# Crowberry Wisp for KDE Plasma. Crowberry tint of Wisp: light, neutrals leaned toward crowberry (base 248,244,255).
# Generated by build.mjs from src/ports/kde.colors. Do not edit ports/kde/.
# Copy into ~/.local/share/color-schemes/, then System Settings > Colors.
#
# KDE splits chrome from content: Window is dialogs and panels, View is the text
# and list areas inside them. Darkberry follows its own split, so Window sits on
# the sidebar colour and View on the background every editor already uses.

